 "answer": "**Part A**\nTo find $87^{520} \\pmod{151}$, note that 151 is prime. Computing powers of 87 modulo 151:\n- $87 \\equiv -64 \\pmod{151}$\n- $87^2 \\equiv 4096 \\equiv 19 \\pmod{151}$\n- $87^4 \\equiv 19^2 = 361 \\equiv 59 \\pmod{151}$\n- $87^5 \\equiv 59 \\times 87 = 5133 = 34 \\times 151 - 1 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{151}$\n\nThus, $87^{10} \\equiv (-1)^2 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{151}$. Since 520 is a multiple of 10, $87^{520} = (87^{10})^{52} \\equiv 1^{52} \\equiv 1 \\pmod{151}$.\n\n**Part B**\nComputing the product step-by-step:\n- $81259 \\times 3738 = 303746142$\n- $303746142 \\times 951 = 288862581042$\n- $288862581042 \\times 8263 = 2386871507150046$\n\nSumming the decimal digits: $2 + 3 + 8 + 6 + 8 + 7 + 1 + 5 + 0 + 7 + 1 + 5 + 0 + 0 + 4 + 6 = 63$.\n\n**Part C**\nStarting at $1,200.00, each month applies the transaction, deducts $15 if below $2,000, and multiplies the resulting balance by $1.004$:\n- Month 1: $(1200 + 300 - 15) \\times 1.004 = 1490.940$\n- Month 2: $(1490.940 + 300 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1783.044$\n- Month 3: $(1783.044 + 300) \\times 1.004 \\approx 2091.376$ (no fee)\n- Month 4: $(2091.376 - 900 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1181.081$\n- Month 5: $(1181.081 - 250 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 919.746$\n- Month 6: $(919.746 + 300 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1209.565$\n- Month 7: $(1209.565 - 400 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 797.743$\n- Month 8: $(797.743 + 450 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1237.674$\n- Month 9: $(1237.674 + 450 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1679.365$\n- Month 10: $(1679.365 - 650 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1018.422$\n- Month 11: $(1018.422 + 700 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1710.236$\n- Month 12: $(1710.236 - 900 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 798.417$\n- Month 13: $(798.417 + 1100 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1890.950$\n- Month 14: $(1890.950 - 400 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1481.854$\n- Month 15: $(1481.854 + 300 - 15) \\times 1.004 \\approx 1773.922$\n\nRounding to the nearest cent gives 1773.92.\n\n**Part D**\nThe combined net factor for growth and fee in each period is $1.02 \\times (1 - 0.0075) = 1.01235$.\nApplying contribution and net growth sequentially across the 12 periods:\n- Period 1: $(8000 + 900) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 9009.915$\n- Period 2: $(9009.915 + 900) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 10032.297$\n- Period 3: $(10032.297 + 600) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 10763.606$\n- Period 4: $(10763.606 + 900) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 11807.653$\n- Period 5: $(11807.653 + 600) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 12560.887$\n- Period 6: $(12560.887 + 250) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 12969.092$\n- Period 7: $(12969.092 + 600) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 13736.670$\n- Period 8: $(13736.670 + 900) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 14817.428$\n- Period 9: $(14817.428 + 600) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 15607.833$\n- Period 10: $(15607.833 + 600) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 16408.000$\n- Period 11: $(16408.000 + 250) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 16863.727$\n- Period 12: $(16863.727 + 0) \\times 1.01235 \\approx 17071.993$\n\nRounding to the nearest cent gives 17071.99.\n\nFINAL: 1; 63; 1773.92; 17071.99"
